# 1️⃣2️⃣ Meeting Rooms

## 📖 Problem

Determine if a person can attend all meetings.

---

### Example

```text
[0,30]
[5,10]
[15,20]
```

Output:

```text
False
```

because intervals overlap.

---

# 1️⃣3️⃣ Greedy Strategy

Sort by:

```text
Start Time
```

If:

```text
Current Start
<
Previous End
```

then overlap exists.

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
bool canAttendMeetings(
    vector<vector<int>>& intervals)
{
    sort(
        intervals.begin(),
        intervals.end()
    );

    for(int i = 1;
        i < intervals.size();
        i++)
    {
        if(intervals[i][0] <
           intervals[i-1][1])
        {
            return false;
        }
    }

    return true;
}
```

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(N log N)

Space: O(1)
```

