# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Most interval problems start with sorting.

✅ Earliest finishing interval is often the optimal choice.

✅ If total resources are insufficient, answer may be impossible.

✅ Two-pass greedy is common in array optimization problems.

✅ Track last occurrence in string partitioning problems.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Sorting by start instead of end.

❌ Forgetting total gas check.

❌ Using one pass for Candy.

❌ Cutting partition too early.

❌ Ignoring interval overlap conditions.

